, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّتَقَٰبِلِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "2:42", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/49.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Confound not truth with falsehood, nor knowingly conceal the truth.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Hakk'ı batıla karıştırıp da, bile bile hakkı gizlemeyin.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور حق سے باطل کو نہ ملاؤ اور دیدہ و دانستہ حق نہ چھپاؤ -", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan janganlah kamu campur adukkan yang hak dengan yang bathil dan janganlah kamu sembunyikan yang hak itu, sedang kamu mengetahui.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَلْبِسُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/2304bc44b957aa617a2d.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "you (all) make vague", "bs": "zamagljujete", "tr": "karıştırırsınız", "fr": "que vous brouilliez", "id": "kalian mengaburkan", "ur": "تم گڈمڈ کرتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা ঘোলাটে কর", "fa": "پوشیده دارید"}}, {"text": "ٱلْحَقَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِٱلْبَٰطِلِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَتَكْتُمُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْحَقَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَنتُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَعْلَمُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "6:9", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/798.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Had we appointed him (Our messenger) an angel, We assuredly had made him (as) a man (that he might speak to men); and (thus) obscured for them (the truth) they (now) obscure.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Eğer Peygamberi, biz bir melek yapsaydık, yine de onu bir adam şeklinde yapardık ve onları yine düştükleri kuşkuya düşürürdük.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور اگر ہم نبی کو فرشتہ کرتے جب بھی اسے مرد ہی بناتے اور ان پر وہی شبہ رکھتے جس میں اب پڑے ہیں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan kalau Kami jadikan rasul itu malaikat, tentulah Kami jadikan dia seorang laki-laki dan (kalau Kami jadikan ia seorang laki-laki), tentulah Kami meragu-ragukan atas mereka apa yang mereka ragu-ragukan atas diri mereka sendiri.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَوْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَعَلْنَٰهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَلَكًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَّجَعَلْنَٰهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَجُلًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَلَبَسْنَا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/5584fd171828531f2c79.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i zamaglili bismo", "en": "and We would have made unclear", "tr": "ve karıştırırdık", "fr": "et Nous aurions rendu confus", "id": "dan niscaya Kami akan mengaburkan", "ur": "اور ہم ضرور مغالطے میں ڈال دیتے", "bn": "এবং আমরা অবশ্যই অস্পষ্ট করে দিতাম", "fa": "و قطعاً مشتبه می‌ساختیم"}}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَلْبِسُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/758a0b8687df5a6f2b02.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "zamagljuju", "en": "they make unclear", "tr": "karıştırırlar", "fr": "ils rendent confus", "id": "mereka mengaburkan", "ur": "وہ مغالطے میں ڈالتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা অস্পষ্ট করে", "fa": "مشتبه می‌کنند"}}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "تَلْبَسُونَهَا", "count": 2, "first": "16:14", "aud